", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h0uQRG0HoU4Q7kNvwHUIZnZ&_nc_oc=AdqJpWnI-NNI4bYKEOj4VSX1srDGbAVP1l9YeZvUn1hHWr8PRG_j_aIUSJAkifNkdpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7YGIFaFNsZ1lYpfYro6ugx4NghdDJEsOWT5xb8kfg5xA&oe=6A047EF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NqtFwnFKSaoQ7kNvwEVyMXd&_nc_oc=AdqGW90afduIY9100IkTnB2IX-twYAAZJF1bDu78lODKZ9kxvKVfL4lH6_9v8ronnqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6pX4XokikCEH5o7E4jcMTD0Vi5p1R7GNN59iAYNuBdbw&oe=6A0495CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iUXJRxOpIv4Q7kNvwHeEbr2&_nc_oc=AdpIM5F2pTwKMOdjPMM3CKffsdg4K6GbsHEjfvSQc986W7wkbxTb0_r3VA2jYzNUbB8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7n1rQ_gatrd5wIEqq3HUD8ScGTe52shghSTbFAH6TVqQ&oe=6A04944E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel